{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40656","headline":"越公上人洛中归寄南孟家兄弟 · 李洞","name":"越公上人洛中归寄南孟家兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛下因归去，官西忆二龙。\n笠漫河岸雪，衣着虢城锺。\n睡鸭浮寒水，樵人出远峰。\n贺当化闾俗，护取草堂松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}